{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌神陳奕迅（Eason）愛女陳康堤早前宣布與香港網球新星黃澤林（Coleman）半年情玩完。</p><p>男方被指「無縫接軌」譚旻萱（Mandy），哄動全城。</p><p>陳奕迅與太太徐濠縈團結一致，全數取消關注黃澤林的帳號，一家三口連成一線。</p><p>康堤亦收拾心情回復工作狀</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:19:46.764953+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T10:01:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:05.888044+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:05.888044+00:00","content_hash":"7655aea5e07ab845fae211145a6f12b5da5df07cd5ded9cb48575350b1c56a37","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}